# Monitoring Dashboards

- Shared JSON lives in `grafana/dashboards/hosts` and `grafana/dashboards/datastores`.
- Product JSON lives in `packs/<project>/dashboards`.
- Folder provisioning is `grafana/provisioning/dashboards/dashboards.yml`.
- Use datasource UID `victoriametrics`.
- Keep dashboard `uid` stable and unique.
- Host panels filter `job="node"` and `server=~"$server"`.
- Datastore panels filter `project` and `env`, not a per-VPS job name.
- A new dashboard folder must be added to the provisioning file and mounted in `docker-compose.yml`.
